emails*/
61125.jpeg

# Local machine's antivirus/proxy SSL-interception root cert, if this dev
# machine needs one trusted inside the build (see backend/Dockerfile and
# frontend/Dockerfile*: COPY'd only if present, via a glob, so its absence
# on any other machine/CI/production is a silent no-op, never a build
# failure). Never something to share or commit — it's specific to whatever
# security software is on THIS Windows box.
*-root-ca.crt
2130850.pdf